{"description":"Deferred credential-hardening follow-up (option B/C of adr:steward-as-eka-cli-plugin). Replace the HOME-based credential file with a source not readable by any same-uid process: an OS keyring (libsecret/Secret Service, macOS Keychain, Windows Credential Manager) OR a per-connection broker over a unix socket or an inherited file descriptor with peer authentication. Preserve the Resolver seam and the broker's least-privilege contract (only driver-declared names reach a worker). Deferred: it is not on the immediate critical path.","acceptanceCriteria":"Declared credentials resolve without a file readable by a same-uid process. | An unauthorized caller is refused on the IPC/keyring path. | The least-privilege contract is unchanged (only driver-declared names reach a worker). | The file-backed resolver can be retired once this ships."}